          "routine_id": null,
          "run_id": "81d1a377-9688-487f-adc0-68b6225b5bb0",
          "purpose": "conversation",
          "source_run_id": null,
          "creation_operation_id": null,
          "text": "Proving the local fixture sign-in — opening the granted browser profile.First navigation hit a snag — retrying with the correct form.The navigate call needs a different encoding — I'll try omitting the empty observation fields.Attached and reading a blank tab — now navigating to the login fixture.Signed in — checking the account page state.Note saved and verified — opening the second tab.Done — one-time local test complete, no goal or routine created.\n\n- Signed in at `http://host.docker.internal:49958/login` with proof name `muse-browser-proof`.\n- Account page `http://host.docker.internal:49958/account` observed:\n  - `Verified account muse-browser-proof`\n  - `Saved note: muse-note-84012` after filling Persistent note with `muse-note-84012` and clicking Save note.\n- Second managed tab `http://host.docker.internal:49958/second` opened with `new_tab=true`, then inspected:\n  - DOM shows `Verified account muse-browser-proof` and `Saved note: muse-note-84012`, plus Persistent note input and Save note button.\n  - Screenshot taken: shows “Second managed tab”, verified account link, input containing `muse-note-84012`, and `Saved note: muse-note-84012`.\n",
          "state": "complete",
          "artifact_ids": []
        },
        {
          "id": "9a639f5f-c309-4cd1-8d4e-2421e631ed36",
          "owner_id": "7ba9c73a-373f-403b-9d70-2e1696a447cf",
          "revision": 1,
